    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n90380" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρόσχορδος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>,
			(<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">χορδή</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>attuned to a stringed instrument</i>: generally,
				<i>in unison with</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποδιδόναι
				πρόσχορδα τὰ φθέγματα τοῖς φθέγμασι</span> bring voices
				<i>into unison with</i> voices, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				812d
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				4.58
			</span></i>,<i><span class="en">
				63
			</span></i>.</div>
